  "description": "This native cottage garden blends English cottage-garden romance with robust Australian native flora. Informal and abundant, it plays with texture and colour — paper daisies, grevilleas and delicate hibbertia weaving a dynamic tapestry that supports birds, bees and butterflies. A gentle basalt path winds through layers of foliage, with seasonal blooms offering year-round interest and the natural hardiness of natives keeping maintenance low.",
